<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts mostly</p>
<p>steady. Demand moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top</p>
<p>$59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country			  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 56.50-58.00, Few 58.50     57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 52.00-56.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 47.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Near Steady. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 44.00-46.50</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 48.00-52.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
